    "description": "Pool lanes under the sole governor (second attribution axis beside plane). Members join a per-pool shared Job Object with bounded cpu/memory/process envelopes; 'members' are lowercase substrings matched against exe path + cmdline. Governance plane is never pooled; excluded programs keep pool attribution for telemetry but join no job. Pool members supersede the generic worker-plane job (a process may hold only one Job).",
